        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/7b1559158ad5574be4170efc60283cbd.avif?t=1760309068\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swamp Keeper is a Korean-style bow action arena shooter inspired by one-shot, one-kill gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the &quot;Swamp Keeper,&quot; defender of the sacred swamp, armed with only a bow to repel invading enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of archery, defeat waves of foes, and take down their commander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/0face3fc332d3ce9ae37f56853a2959a.poster.avif?t=1760309068\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/0face3fc332d3ce9ae37f56853a2959a.webm?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/0face3fc332d3ce9ae37f56853a2959a.mp4?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ho’s forces have invaded the sacred swamp, targeting its precious resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wielding iron and fire, the enemy has already reached the heart of the swamp shrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the sworn guardian of these wetlands, it’s your duty to drive them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/91aac68fa814bb5bd4c85d4818b1647d.poster.avif?t=1760309068\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/91aac68fa814bb5bd4c85d4818b1647d.webm?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/91aac68fa814bb5bd4c85d4818b1647d.mp4?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With support from your allies, traverse the battlefield and restore peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/2b7e1a82aa7563630c24f2aa57d6d529.poster.avif?t=1760309068\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/2b7e1a82aa7563630c24f2aa57d6d529.webm?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/2b7e1a82aa7563630c24f2aa57d6d529.mp4?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull, aim, release — experience the high-stakes tension of one-shot, one-kill charging bow action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/bb877a9de2443b410fa63663aa03dcf5.poster.avif?t=1760309068\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/bb877a9de2443b410fa63663aa03dcf5.webm?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/bb877a9de2443b410fa63663aa03dcf5.mp4?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft arrows that suit your style, select your skills, and prepare for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/14abf32749852d2360162670c625b13b.poster.avif?t=1760309068\" width=1140 height=738 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/14abf32749852d2360162670c625b13b.webm?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/14abf32749852d2360162670c625b13b.mp4?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy charming Korean-style anthropomorphic characters and beautifully rendered backgrounds.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/7b1559158ad5574be4170efc60283cbd.avif?t=1760309068\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swamp Keeper is a Korean-style bow action arena shooter inspired by one-shot, one-kill gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the &quot;Swamp Keeper,&quot; defender of the sacred swamp, armed with only a bow to repel invading enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of archery, defeat waves of foes, and take down their commander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/0face3fc332d3ce9ae37f56853a2959a.poster.avif?t=1760309068\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/0face3fc332d3ce9ae37f56853a2959a.webm?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/0face3fc332d3ce9ae37f56853a2959a.mp4?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ho’s forces have invaded the sacred swamp, targeting its precious resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wielding iron and fire, the enemy has already reached the heart of the swamp shrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the sworn guardian of these wetlands, it’s your duty to drive them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/91aac68fa814bb5bd4c85d4818b1647d.poster.avif?t=1760309068\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/91aac68fa814bb5bd4c85d4818b1647d.webm?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/91aac68fa814bb5bd4c85d4818b1647d.mp4?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With support from your allies, traverse the battlefield and restore peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/2b7e1a82aa7563630c24f2aa57d6d529.poster.avif?t=1760309068\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/2b7e1a82aa7563630c24f2aa57d6d529.webm?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/2b7e1a82aa7563630c24f2aa57d6d529.mp4?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull, aim, release — experience the high-stakes tension of one-shot, one-kill charging bow action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/bb877a9de2443b410fa63663aa03dcf5.poster.avif?t=1760309068\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/bb877a9de2443b410fa63663aa03dcf5.webm?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/bb877a9de2443b410fa63663aa03dcf5.mp4?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft arrows that suit your style, select your skills, and prepare for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/14abf32749852d2360162670c625b13b.poster.avif?t=1760309068\" width=1140 height=738 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/14abf32749852d2360162670c625b13b.webm?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/14abf32749852d2360162670c625b13b.mp4?t=1760309068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy charming Korean-style anthropomorphic characters and beautifully rendered backgrounds.</p>",
